{"ref":"BDB, שָׂכִיר","hw":"שָׂכִיר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂכִיר</span></big>  <strong>adj. hired</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:45\" href=\"/Exodus.12.45\">Ex 12:45</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂכִירָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7:20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂכִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:53\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.53\">Lv 25:53</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂכִירְךָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.6\">6</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂכִרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.21\">Je 46:21</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>hired</em>, of beast <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:14\" href=\"/Exodus.22.14\">Ex 22:14</a> (E), razor <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7:20</a> (fig.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  usually as subst. <em>hireling, hired labourer</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.18\">Dt 15:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.14\">24:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.13\">Lv 19:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.10\">22:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.6\">25:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:40\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.40\">40</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:53\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.53\">53</a> (all H), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:45\" href=\"/Exodus.12.45\">Ex 12:45</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:50\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.50\">Lv 25:50</a> (both P), <a data-ref=\"Malachi 3:5\" href=\"/Malachi.3.5\">Mal 3:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 7:1\" href=\"/Job.7.1\">Jb 7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 7:2\" href=\"/Job.7.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:6\" href=\"/Job.14.6\">14:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּשְׁנֵי שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.14\">Is 16:14</a> years <em>like a hireling’s years</em> (reckoned strictly), so <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.16\">21:16</a>; <em>mercenaries</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.21\">Je 46:21</a>.","next":"BDB, יִשָּׂשׂכָר","prev":"BDB, שָׂכָר²"}